msgstr "&Manfred.Wiese;"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:39
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"&kchart; is an application for visualizing numerical data. It has many "
"different chart types available like bar graphs, line plots, pie charts, "
"ring charts and more."
msgstr ""
"Mit &kchart; laat sik nummeersch Daten graafsch dorstellen. Dat Programm "
"stellt verscheden Diagrammtypen praat, a.B. Balken-, Regen-, Koken-, "
"Ringdiagrammen un mehr."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:44
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"&kchart; is a &koffice; component and is very well integrated with &kspread; "
"to allow visualization of spreadsheet data. But it is also possible to use "
"&kchart; as a standalone application or integrate it in other &koffice; "
"components."
msgstr ""
"&kchart; is Deel vun &koffice;, un arbeidt bannig goot mit &kspread; "
"tosamen, so dat sik dor ok Daten ut Tabellen mit dorstellen laat. &kchart; "
"lett sik man ok as egen Programm bruken, oder na anner &koffice;-Komponenten "
"inbinnen."

#. Tag: keyword
#: index.docbook:53
#, no-c-format
msgid "<keyword>KDE</keyword>"
msgstr "<keyword>KDE</keyword>"

#. Tag: keyword
#: index.docbook:54
#, no-c-format
msgid "kdeutils"
msgstr "kdeutils"

#. Tag: keyword
#: index.docbook:55
#, no-c-format
