msgstr "KChart"

#. Tag: keyword
#: index.docbook:56
#, no-c-format
msgid "chart"
msgstr "Diagramm"

#. Tag: keyword
#: index.docbook:57
#, no-c-format
msgid "graph"
msgstr "Grafik"

#. Tag: keyword
#: index.docbook:58
#, no-c-format
msgid "plot"
msgstr "Teken"

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:65
#, no-c-format
msgid "Introduction"
msgstr "Inföhren"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:67
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"&kchart; is a tool for visualizing numerical data. It can be used as a "
"standalone application with a simple &dataeditor;. But as a &koffice; "
"component it offers very flexible integration. &kspread; uses the &kchart; "
"component for charts and diagrams. &kspread; can be seen as a very powerful "
"data provider for &kchart; input."
msgstr ""
"&kchart; is en Programm, mit dat sik nummeersch Daten graafsch dorstellen "
"laat, un dat sik mit en eenfach &dataeditor; as Enkelprogramm bruken lett. "
"Man as &koffice;-Komponent stellt dat ok bannig topasste Inbedden praat. "
"&kspread; bruukt de &kchart;-Komponent för Diagrammen. &kspread; kann "
"sotoseggen as deegten Datenanbeder för &kchart;-Ingaven sehn warrn."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:74
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"But embedding is not limited to &kspread;. A &kchart; chart can be embedded "
"in many of the &koffice; components like &kword;, &kpresenter; or &kivio;."
msgstr ""
"Man Inbedden is nich bloots op &kspread; ingrenzt. En &kchart;-Diagramm lett "
"sik na mehr vun de &koffice;-Komponenten inbedden, a.B. na &kword;, "
"&kpresenter; oder &kivio;."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:79
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"To start with we will look at the user interface of &kchart; and how it can "
"be used as a standalone application. When we are familiar with &kchart; we "
"will investigate the charting capabilities it offers together with &kspread;."
msgstr ""
"Nu kiekt wi us eerstmaal de Böversiet vun &kchart; an, un wodennig se sik as "
"Enkelprogramm bruken lett. Wenn wi dat denn weet, kiekt wi us an, wodennig "
"&kchart; mit &kspread; tosamenarbeidt."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:88
#, no-c-format
msgid "The User Interface"
msgstr "De Böversiet"

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:90
#, no-c-format
msgid "Main Application Interface"
msgstr "Hööftprogramm-Böversiet"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:91
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"We will take a look at a simple example to get to know &kchart;. Along the "
"way we will also discuss the user interface at length so you will learn "
"about many details of the component."
msgstr ""
"Wi kiekt us en eenfach Bispill an, dormit wi mehr över &kchart; lehrt. Dorbi "
"warrt ok de Böversiet un ehr Enkelheiten utföhrlich verklort."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:96
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"When you start &kchart; as a standalone application you get the usual "
"startup dialog where you can choose between different templates or load "
"existing chart documents."
msgstr ""
"Wenn Du &kchart; as Enkelprogramm utföhrst, warrt de normaal Startdialoog "
"wiest, un Du kannst Di ut en Reeg vun Vörlagen een utsöken, oder en "
"vörhannen Diagrammdokment laden."

#. Tag: screeninfo
#: index.docbook:102
#, no-c-format
msgid "&kchart; Startup Dialog"
msgstr "&kchart;-Startdialoog"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:109
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"You can choose between various ways to startup &kchart;. On the left, you "
"can see three options: <guilabel>Recent Documents</guilabel>, "
"<guilabel>Charts</guilabel> templates and <guilabel>Open Existing Document..."
"</guilabel>. The first option lets you choose between recently opened "
"charts, the second is for creating a new chart from various templates and "
"the third is for opening an existing chart with a file dialog."
msgstr ""
"&kchart; lett sik op verscheden Oorden starten. Linkerhand kannst Du de dree "
"Optschonen sehn: <guilabel>Tolest bruukte Dokmenten</guilabel>, "
"<guilabel>Diagrammen</guilabel>-Vörlagen un den Knoop <guilabel>Vörhannen "
"Dokment opmaken...</guilabel>. Mit de eerste Optschoon kannst Du binnen "
"verleden opmaakt Diagrammen stövern un utsöken, mit de twete lett sik ut "
"verscheden Vörlagen en nieg Diagramm opstellen, un de drüdde maakt en "
"Dateidialoog för't Opmaken vun en vörhannen Diagramm op."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:118
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"For now we will start with the default template. Select <guilabel>Charts</"
"guilabel> in the left area and then select <guilabel>Bar Chart</guilabel> in "
"the main template area. Normally this template should already be selected "
"after choosing <guilabel>Charts</guilabel>."
msgstr ""
"Wi fangt eerstmaal mit en Standardvörlag an. Söök toeerst links "
"<guilabel>Diagrammen</guilabel> ut, un denn ut de Vörlagen "
"<guilabel>Balkendiagramm</guilabel>. Normalerwies is disse Vörlaag na Köör "
"vun <guilabel>Diagrammen</guilabel> al vörinstellt."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:125
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"If you decide to always start &kchart; with a selected template as default "
"you can also check <guilabel>Always use this template</guilabel>."
msgstr ""
"Wenn Du &kchart; standardwies jümmers mit de sülve Vörlaag starten wullt, "
"kannst Du ok <guilabel>Jümmers disse Vörlaag bruken</guilabel> anmaken."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:129
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Click the <guibutton>Use This Template</guibutton> button on the right, "
"under the template preview."
msgstr ""
"Klick op den Knoop <guibutton>Disse Vörlaag bruken</guibutton> op de rechte "
"Siet nerrn de Vörlaag-Vöransicht."

#. Tag: screeninfo
#: index.docbook:134
#, no-c-format
msgid "&kchart; User Interface"
msgstr "&kchart;-Böversiet"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:141
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"As you can see, there is already some example data present. &kchart; offers "
"the default toolbar for creating a new chart, saving, loading and printing "
"the chart. The second toolbar offers icons for editing the data, configuring "
"the chart or using a configuration wizard. You can also switch between "
"different chart types with the rest of the icons. Note that some of these "
"chart types also have subtypes."
msgstr ""
"As Du sehn kannst, gifft dat al en poor Bispilldaten. &kchart; stellt den "
"Standardwarktüüchbalken för't Opstellen vun en niegen Diagramm un för't "
"Sekern, Laden un Drucken vun Diagrammen praat. De twete Warktüüchbalken "
"stellt de Lüttbiller för't Bewerken vun Daten, Diagramminstellen un en "
"Instellen-Hölper praat. Mit de anner Lüttbiller lett sik twüschen de "
"verscheden Diagrammtypen wesseln. Beacht, dat dat för en poor Diagrammtypen "
"ok Ünnertypen gifft."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:149
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The menu offers all standard entries, including shortcut and toolbar "
"configuration and page layout for printing."
msgstr ""
"Dat Menü stellt all Standardindrääg praat, ok Instellen för "
"Tastkombinatschonen, den Warktüüchbalken un dat Siet-Utsehn för't Drucken."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:153
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Note that data editing is not available if you use &kchart; from within "
"&kspread; because all data is provided by the spreadsheet. As a standalone "
"application the &dataeditor; is an important part of the application."
msgstr ""
"Beacht, dat dat Bewerken vun Daten mit &kchart; nich verföögbor is, wenn dat "
"binnen &kspread; start warrt, wiel all Daten ut de Tabell praatstellt warrt. "
"As Enkelprogramm is de  &dataeditor; en wichtig Programmdeel."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:161
#, no-c-format
msgid "Chart Wizard"
msgstr "Diagramm-Hölper"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:162
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The wizard is actually a very useful part of &kchart; for quickly setting up "
"some basic options like chart type and chart labelling in a few easy steps."
msgstr ""
"De Hölper is redig en bannig bruukbor Deel vun &kchart;, wenn Een bloots gau "
"un eenfach en poor Grundoptschonen fastleggen will, as a.B. den Diagrammtyp "
"oder de Beschriften."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:167
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"You can run the wizard at any time, it will always preserve your data and "
"other configuration. Also, you can change every single configuration you do "
"with the wizard later as well, without losing anything. In fact the wizard "
"is just a way to set some basic and important options in one go."
msgstr ""
"De Hölper lett sik jümmers utföhren. Dien Daten un anner Instellen blifft "
"wohrt. Du kannst mit em ok later elk Instellen ahn Datenverlusten ännern. "
"Mit den Hölper laat sik eenfach en poor Grundinstellen un wichtige "
"Optschonen op eenmaal ännern."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:174
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"To start the wizard simply click on the <inlinemediaobject><imageobject> "
"<imagedata fileref=\"cr22-action-wizard.png\" format=\"PNG\"/> </"
"imageobject></inlinemediaobject> icon in the toolbar."
msgstr ""
"Wenn Du den Hölper starten wullt, klick in'n Warktüüchbalken op dat Lüttbild "
"<inlinemediaobject><imageobject> <imagedata fileref=\"cr22-action-wizard.png"
"\" format=\"PNG\"/> </imageobject></inlinemediaobject>."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:182
#, no-c-format
msgid "Step 0 - Choosing the Data source"
msgstr "Schritt 0: Datenborn utsöken"

#. Tag: screeninfo
#: index.docbook:184
#, no-c-format
msgid "Wizard Step 0 - Data source"
msgstr "Hölper, Schritt 0 - Datenborn"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:191
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The first step in the wizard is to actually choose the data source. If the "
"selected data area does not match the data you want, select the data now."
msgstr ""
"Toeerst warrt de Datenborn utsöcht. Wenn dat utsöcht Datenrebeet nich de "
"passen Daten bargt, söök nu de Daten ut."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:195
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Include cells that you want to use as row and column labels, if you want "
"them in the chart."
msgstr ""
"Föög de Zellen to, de Du as Regen- oder Striepenbeschriften binnen dat "
"Diagramm bruken wullt."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:198
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Then go to the next step with the <guibutton>Next &gt;</guibutton> button. "
"You can also choose <guibutton>Finish</guibutton> at any step if you are "
"already comfortable with the setup done so far."
msgstr ""
"Denn maak mit den Knoop <guibutton>Nakamen &gt;</guibutton> wieder. Du "
"kannst den Hölper man ok jümmers mit den Knoop <guibutton>Fardig maken</"
"guibutton> utmaken, wenn Di de Instellen al toseggt."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:206
#, no-c-format
msgid "Step 1 - Choosing the Chart Type"
msgstr "Schritt 1: Diagrammtyp utsöken"

#. Tag: screeninfo
#: index.docbook:208
#, no-c-format
msgid "Wizard Step 1 - Chart Type"
msgstr "Hölper, Schritt 1 - Diagrammtyp"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:215
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The next step in the wizard is to actually choose the primary type of the "
"chart. This selection has the most important impact on how your data will be "
"presented. Thus it should be chosen well. You can change the type of the "
"chart with the icons in the toolbar without losing any data or configuration "
"later on. In fact it is even considered normal to test all the various chart "
"types to find the best fitting."
msgstr ""
"Nu warrt de Hööfttyp vun dat Diagram utsöcht. Disse Köör wart sik an'n "
"mehrsten op de Datenpresentatschoon. Söök also mit Bedacht ut. De "
"Diagrammtyp lett sik later ok noch ahn Daten- oder Instellenverlusten mit de "
"Lüttbiller binnen den Warktüüchbalken ännern, so dat Du denn ok noch den "
"Diagrammtyp utsöken kannst, de Di op't best för Dien Daten toseggt."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:224
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"In this example we choose the <guilabel>Lines</guilabel> type. Depending on "
"the chosen chart type different options are available in the following steps."
msgstr ""
"För dit Bispill söökt wi den Typ <guilabel>Regen</guilabel> ut. Afhangen vun "
"den Diagrammtyp sünd för de nakamen Schreed verscheden Optschonen verföögbor."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:229
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"After chosing the type you can get to the next step with the <guibutton>Next "
"&gt;</guibutton> button."
msgstr ""
"Nadeem Du den Typ utsöcht hest, geiht dat mit den Knoop <guibutton>Nakamen "
"&gt;</guibutton> wieder."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:235
#, no-c-format
msgid "Step 2 - Choosing the Subtype"
msgstr "Schritt 2: Ünnertyp utsöken"

#. Tag: screeninfo
#: index.docbook:237
#, no-c-format
msgid "Wizard Step 2 - Chart Sub Type"
msgstr "Hölper, Schritt 2 - Ünnertyp utsöken"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:244
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"In case the chosen chart type has various sub types you can choose it in the "
"second step. If the chart type has no sub types, this step will be skipped "
"automatically."
msgstr ""
"Wenn de Diagrammtyp noch Ünnertypen bargt, laat se sik hier utsöken. Wenn de "
"Diagrammtyp keen Ünnertypen bargt, warrt disse Schritt automaatsch övergahn."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:249
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"If you decide to change the sub type later, you can do this in the "
"appropriate configuration dialog which will be shown later."
msgstr ""
"Wenn Du den Ünnertyp later ännern wullt, kannst Du dat binnen den tohören "
"Instellendialoog doon, de later wiest warrt."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:254
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"You can simply leave the default selection and go to the next step. Of "
"course you can chose any desired sub type if you want."
msgstr ""
"Du kannst de Standardinstellen eenfach so laten, un na den nakamen Schritt "
"gahn. Natüürlich lett sik ok elk Ünnertyp utsöken, wenn Du wullt."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:260
#, no-c-format
msgid "Step 3 - Labels and Legend, Fonts"
msgstr "Schritt 3: Beschriften, Verkloren un Schriftoorden"

#. Tag: screeninfo
#: index.docbook:262
#, no-c-format
msgid "Wizard Step 3 - Labels and Legend"
msgstr "Hölper, Schritt 3 - Beschriften un Verkloren"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:269
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"In the third step you can set the text for the chart title, the axes and the "
"legend. You can also configure the desired font in detail for each of these."
msgstr ""
"Hier kannst Du den Text för den Diagrammtitel fastleggen, de Assen, un de "
"Verkloren. Du kannst ok för elk Indrag en egen Schriftoort instellen."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:276
#, no-c-format
msgid "Step 4 - Axes"
msgstr "Schritt 4: Assen"

#. Tag: screeninfo
#: index.docbook:278
#, no-c-format
msgid "Wizard Step 4 - Axes"
msgstr "Hölper, Schritt 4 - Assen"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:285
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The last step of the wizard lets you set various options for the axes and "
"other options, depending on the chart type."
msgstr ""
"Oplest kannst Du noch verscheden Optschonen för de Assen un anner Instellen "
"fastleggen, afhangen vun den Diagrammtyp."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:289
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"You can either choose <guibutton>Finish</guibutton> to accept the options "
"for your chart, go <guibutton>&lt; Back</guibutton> and change various "
"things or simply dismiss all options from the wizard by choosing "
"<guibutton>Cancel</guibutton>."
msgstr ""
"Du kannst nu mit den Knoop <guibutton>Fardig maken</guibutton> de Instellen "
"för Dien Diagramm annehmen, mit <guibutton>&lt; Torüch</guibutton> noch "
"torüchgahn un dit un dat ännern, oder mit <guibutton>Afbreken</guibutton> "
"den Hölper sien Instellen eenfach all wegdoon."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:295
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"If you choose <guibutton>Finish</guibutton> all your choices in the wizard "
"will be integrated in the chart and you can continue to enter some data and "
"do some fine tuning of various options."
msgstr ""
"Wenn Du op <guibutton>Fardig maken</guibutton> klickst, denn warrt de "
"Instellen vun den Hölper na Dien Diagramm övernahmen, un Du kannst "
"wiedermaken un en poor Daten ingeven un noch verscheden Optschonen nauer "
"instellen."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:300
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Remember that the chart configuration dialog has many more options "
"available, we will discuss these later."
msgstr ""
"Beacht, dat de Diagramm-Instellendialoog noch mehr Optschonen bargt, de wi "
"us man later noch ankiekt."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:307
#, no-c-format
msgid "The &dataeditor;"
msgstr "De &dataeditor;"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:308
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The &dataeditor; can be reached by selecting <menuchoice> <guimenu>Edit</"
"guimenu><guimenuitem>Edit Data...</guimenuitem> </menuchoice> from the menu "
"or by clicking on the <inlinemediaobject><imageobject> <imagedata fileref="
"\"cr22-action-data.png\" format=\"PNG\"/> </imageobject></inlinemediaobject> "
"icon in the toolbar."
msgstr ""
"De &dataeditor; lett sik mit <menuchoice> <guimenu>Bewerken</"
"guimenu><guimenuitem>Daten bewerken...</guimenuitem> </menuchoice> ut dat "
"Menü opropen, oder mit en Klick op dat Lüttbild "
"<inlinemediaobject><imageobject> <imagedata fileref=\"cr22-action-data.png\" "
"format=\"PNG\"/> </imageobject></inlinemediaobject> binnen den "
"Warktüüchbalken."

#. Tag: screeninfo
#: index.docbook:317
#, no-c-format
msgid "&dataeditor; in standalone mode"
msgstr "De &dataeditor; in'n Enkelbedrief"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:324
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The &dataeditor; can be used to set all values. You can also define the "
"number of rows and columns."
msgstr ""
"Mit den &dataeditor; laat sik all Weerten fastleggen, un ok de Tall vun "
"Regen un Striepen instellen."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:328
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Depending on the chart type rows and columns have different representations. "
"Each row can generally be considered to be one data series or data set while "
"each column represents the values of all data sets at a certain location."
msgstr ""
"De Bedüden vun Regen un Striepen hangt vun den Diagramtyp af. Allmeen warrt "
"elk Reeg as een Datenreeg oder Datensett behannelt, un elk Striep stellt de "
"Weerten vun all Datensetten op en angeven Steed dor."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:333
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The name of a data set can be changed by clicking on the row header (left of "
"the first column with values). The name of a column can be changed by "
"clicking on the column header (above the first row)."
msgstr ""
"En Datensettnaam lett sik dör Anklicken vun de Regenöverschrift (links vun "
"den eersten Striep mit Weerten) ännern. En Striepnaam dör Klicken op de "
"Striepöverschrift (böver de eerste Reeg). "

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:339
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The number of rows and columns can be adjusted to fit the needs. Since "
"version 1.4 the restriction to 16 rows and 16 columns has been eliminated."
msgstr ""
"De Tall vun Regen un Striepen lett sik na Möög topassen. Vun Verschoon 1.4 "
"af gifft dat de Bövergrenz vun 16 Regen un 16 Striepen nich mehr."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:346
#, no-c-format
msgid "Chart Configuration"
msgstr "Diagramminstellen"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:347
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"&kchart; offers many configuration options for the chart. These are "
"available in standalone mode and when embedded in &kspread;"
msgstr ""
"&kchart; stellt en Barg Instellen för dat Diagramm praat. Se sünd in'n "
"Enkelbedrief verföögbor, man ok, wenn &kchart; na &kspread; inbett is."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:351
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Depending on the chart type you have selected, the available options are "
"slightly different. Let's choose the line chart type by clicking on the "
"<inlinemediaobject><imageobject> <imagedata fileref=\"cr22-action-chart_line."
"png\" format=\"PNG\"/> </imageobject></inlinemediaobject> icon in the "
"toolbar."
msgstr ""
"De veföögbor Optschonen hangt vun den utsöchten Diagrammtyp af. Wi söökt us "
"nu maal mit en Klick op dat Lüttbild <inlinemediaobject><imageobject> "
"<imagedata fileref=\"cr22-action-chart_line.png\" format=\"PNG\"/> </"
"imageobject></inlinemediaobject> in'n Warktüüchbalken en Lienendiagramm as "
"Typ ut."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:358
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"To get to the chart configuration dialog, select <menuchoice> "
"<guimenu>Format</guimenu> <guimenuitem>Chart...</guimenuitem> </menuchoice> "
"from the menu or click on the <inlinemediaobject><imageobject> <imagedata "
"fileref=\"cr22-action-options.png\" format=\"PNG\"/> </imageobject></"
"inlinemediaobject> icon in the toolbar. You might need to click on the right "
"or left arrow at the top of the dialog to get all pages if the width of the "
"dialog is too small."
msgstr ""
"In't Menü geiht dat mit <menuchoice> <guimenu>Formaat</guimenu> "
"<guimenuitem>Diagramm...</guimenuitem> </menuchoice>, oder mit en Klick op "
"<inlinemediaobject><imageobject> <imagedata fileref=\"cr22-action-options.png"
"\" format=\"PNG\"/> </imageobject></inlinemediaobject> na den "
"Instellendialoog."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:369
#, no-c-format
msgid "Row and Column Swapping"
msgstr "Reeg- un Strieptuusch"

#. Tag: screeninfo
#: index.docbook:371
#, no-c-format
msgid "Configuration page 1 - Row/column swapping"
msgstr "Instellensiet 1: Reeg/Striep tuschen"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:378
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The first configuration page can be used to swap the interpretation of rows "
"and columns. By default one row is considered to be a data set and each "
"column holds the individual values of the data series. Here you can choose "
"to have a each column hold one data set. Note that the values are not really "
"swapped but only their interpretation."
msgstr ""
"Op de eerste Instellensiet lett sik de Utdüden vun Regen un Striepen "
"tuschen. Standardwies bargt en Reeg den Datensett un elk Striep de enkelten "
"Datenreegweerten. Hier lett sik instellen, dat elk Striep en Datensett "
"bargt. Beacht, dat de Weerten nich redig tuuscht warrt, man bloots ehr "
"Utdüden."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:389
#, no-c-format
msgid "Chart Subtype"
msgstr "Diagramm-Ünnertyp"

#. Tag: screeninfo
#: index.docbook:391
#, no-c-format
msgid "Configuration page 2 - Chart Subtype"
msgstr "Instellensiet 2: Diagramm-Ünnertyp"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:398
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The second page can be used to select the desired sub type of a chart. The "
"available sub types depend on the chart type, in this case the line chart. "
"Some chart types have no sub type at all in which case this configuration "
"page is not shown. You also get a preview for each subtype."
msgstr ""
"Op de twete Instellensiet lett sik de vörtrocken Ünnertyp för dat Diagramm "
"fastleggen. De verföögbor Ünnertypen hangt vun den Diagrammtyp af, hier dat "
"Lienendiagramm. För en poor Diagrammtypen, de överhööft keen Ünnertypen "
"bargt, warrt disse Instellensiet denn ok nich wiest. För elk Ünnertyp is en "
"Vöransicht verföögbor."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:405
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Remember that the chart type can be chosen from the toolbar while the "
"subtype can be set through this configuration dialog."
msgstr ""
"Beacht, dat sik de Diagrammtyp in'n Warktüüchbalken utsöken lett, man dat "
"sik de Ünnertyp in dissen Instellendialoog fastleggen lett."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:411
#, no-c-format
msgid "Header and Footer"
msgstr "Kopp- un Footreeg"

#. Tag: screeninfo
#: index.docbook:413
#, no-c-format
msgid "Configuration page 3 - Header and Footer"
msgstr "Instellensiet 3: Kopp- un Footreeg"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:420
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"On the third page you can set the title, the subtitle and the footer of the "
"chart, each with individual font settings."
msgstr ""
"Op de drüdde Siet laat sik för Titel, Ünnertitel un de Footreeg vun dat "
"Diagramm egen Schriftoorden instellen."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:426
#, no-c-format
msgid "Legend"
msgstr "Verkloren"

#. Tag: screeninfo
#: index.docbook:428
#, no-c-format
msgid "Configuration page 4 - Legend"
msgstr "Instellensiet 4: Verkloren"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:435
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The legend configuration page lets you set all aspects of the legend. The "
"legend contains the names for all data sets with the respective colors, this "
"is important to identify the data on the chart."
msgstr ""
"Op disse Instellensiet laat sik all Ansichten för de Verkloren fastleggen. "
"De Verkloren bargt de Naams för all Datensetten un ehr Klören, dormit sik de "
"Daten binnen dat Diagramm düden laat."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:440
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The <guilabel>General</guilabel> box holds the title of the legend, which is "
"displayed at the top of the legend box. The <guilabel>Position</guilabel> "
"box can be used to place the legend at various locations on the chart. Use "
"the central button to hide the legend."
msgstr ""
"Dat Feld <guilabel>Allmeen</guilabel> bargt den Verklorentitel, de baven "
"binnen den Verklorenkasten wiest warrt. Mit dat Feld <guilabel>Positschoon</"
"guilabel> lett sik de Verkloren na verscheden Steden binnen dat Diagramm "
"utrichten, un mit den Knoop in de Merrn versteken."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:446
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The <guilabel>Font</guilabel> box can be used to set different fonts for the "
"legend title and the individual entries. Additionally you can set different "
"colors in the <guilabel>Color</guilabel> box."
msgstr ""
"In't Finster <guilabel>Schriftoort</guilabel> laat sik verscheden "
"Schriftoorden för den Verklorentitel un för de enkelten Indrääg fastleggen. "
"In't Finster <guilabel>Klöör</guilabel> laat sik ok noch verscheden Klören "
"instellen."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:453
#, no-c-format
msgid "Axes"
msgstr "Assen"

#. Tag: screeninfo
#: index.docbook:455
#, no-c-format
msgid "Configuration page 5 - Axes"
msgstr "Instellensiet 5: Assen"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:462
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The <guilabel>Axes</guilabel> page holds configuration for the chart axes. "
"This page highly depends on the chart type chosen. For the line chart you "
"can set linear or logarithmic scales and turn the grid on and off."
msgstr ""
"Dat Finster <guilabel>Assen</guilabel> bargt de Instellen för de "
"Diagrammassen. Se hangt ok wedder vun den Diagrammtyp af. För dat "
"Lienendiagramm lett sik en lineaar oder en logarithmisch Skala utsöken, un "
"dat Gadder an- oder utmaken."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:470
#, no-c-format
msgid "Colors"
msgstr "Klören"

#. Tag: screeninfo
#: index.docbook:472
#, no-c-format
msgid "Configuration page 6 - Colors"
msgstr "Instellensiet 6: Klören"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:479
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"On the <guilabel>Colors</guilabel> page you can choose the colors for the "
"individual data sets. You can also set colors for some general chart parts "
"like axes <guilabel>Line color</guilabel> and <guilabel>Grid color</"
"guilabel>."
msgstr ""
"In't Finster <guilabel>Klören</guilabel> laat sik de Klören för de "
"Datensetten un en poor allmeen Diagrammkomponenten, as a.B. Assen, "
"<guilabel>Lienen-</guilabel> un <guilabel>Gadderklöör</guilabel> instellen."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:486
#, no-c-format
msgid "Font"
msgstr "Schriftoort"

#. Tag: screeninfo
#: index.docbook:488
#, no-c-format
msgid "Configuration page 7 - Font"
msgstr "Instellensiet 7: Schriftoort"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:495
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The <guilabel>Font</guilabel> page can be used to configure various fonts "
"like titles, axes labels and so on. Some of these fonts can be set on other "
"pages as well, but on the font page you have them all in one place."
msgstr ""
"Op de Siet <guilabel>Schriftoort</guilabel> laat sik de verscheden "
"Schriftoorden för de Assen, Beteken, usw. instellen. En poor Instellen laat "
"sik twaars ok op anner Sieden fastleggen, man op de Schriftoordensiet sünd "
"se all tohoop oplist."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:503
#, no-c-format
msgid "Background"
msgstr "Achtergrund"

#. Tag: screeninfo
#: index.docbook:505
#, no-c-format
msgid "Configuration page 8 - Background"
msgstr "Instellensiet 8: Achtergrund"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:512
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"On the <guilabel>Background</guilabel> page you will find various options "
"for tweaking the background settings of the chart. You can either choose "
"different background colors or even a background picture."
msgstr ""
"Op de Siet <guilabel>Achtergrund</guilabel> laat sik de Achtergrundinstellen "
"för dat Diagramm fastleggen. Du kannst verscheden Achtergrundklören oder ok "
"en Achtergrundbild utsöken."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:519
#, no-c-format
msgid "More..."
msgstr "Mehr..."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:520
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"This short overview of the configuration options gave you an introduction to "
"the configuration possibilities of your chart, it is by no means complete. "
"Different chart types like <guilabel>Bar</guilabel>, <guilabel>Line</"
"guilabel> and <guilabel>Pie</guilabel>, have additional specialised "
"configuration pages and you are welcome to look around, try different chart "
"types and look at the configuration possibilities. Use the tooltips and read "
"the What's This? help. To use the What's This? help simply click on the "
"question mark on the window decoration and then click on the area of the "
"configuration page you want get more information on."
msgstr ""
"Mit disse Kortöversicht hest Du en Inföhren över en poor Diagramminstellen "
"kregen, man noch nich för all. För anner Diagrammtypen, a.B. "
"<guilabel>Balken</guilabel>, <guilabel>Lien</guilabel> un <guilabel>Koken</"
"guilabel>, gifft dat noch mehr Instellensieden, de Du Di maal ankieken "
"kannst. Probeer de Diagrammtypen ut un kiek Di ehr Instellenmööglichkeiten "
"an. Lees de Kortinformatschonen un de \"Wat is dat?\"-Hülp. Wenn Du de \"Wat "
"is dat?\"-Hülp bruken wullt, klick eenfach op dat Fraagteken un dorna op dat "
"Rebeet binnen den Instellendialoog, över den Du mehr weten wullt."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:538
#, no-c-format
msgid "&kchart; as a standalone Application"
msgstr "&kchart; as Enkelprogramm"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:539
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The previous chapter described the user interface, various configuration "
"options, data editing and the wizard in detail."
msgstr ""
"De verleden Afsnitt hett de Böversiet, verscheden Instellen, den Dateneditor "
"un den Hölper utföhrlich verklort."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:544
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"This chapter gives real-life examples on how to use &kchart; in various "
"situations as a standalone application. The purpose is to give you some "
"understanding of the way &kchart; works and how various parts relate to each "
"other."
msgstr ""
"Disse Afsnitt bargt Bispillen ut dat richtige Leven un wiest, wodennig sik "
"&kchart; in verscheden Situatschonen as Enkelprogramm bruken lett. Dat "
"schall Di de Funkschonen vun &kchart; verkloren un wiesen, wodennig de "
"verscheden Delen tosamenhangt"

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:551
#, no-c-format
msgid "Presenting Sales Figures"
msgstr "Ümsätz dorstellen"

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:553
#, no-c-format
msgid "Warming up"
msgstr "Torechtmaken"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:554
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"This first example which might often be encountered in real life is "
"presenting sales figures, or in this particular case profit."
msgstr ""
"Dit Bispill, dat ok in't richtige Leven faken opduken kann, stellt de "
"Ümsätz, oder beter, den Winn dor."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:559
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Imagine you own a company that has three main categories of business: sales, "
"support and training. And you would like to present the profit of these "
"categories over some years. Making a graphical statistics is certainly a "
"good idea. &kchart; can help you here."
msgstr ""
"Stell Di vör, Du büst de Baas vun en egen Bedrief mit de dree Telgen "
"Verkoop, Repareren un Wiederbillen. Nu wullt Du Di ankieken, woveel Winn Du "
"dormit binnen en Tietruum vun en poor Johren maakt hest. Dor is en graafsch "
"Statistik de richtige Idee för, un &kchart; kann Di dorbi hölpen."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:568
#, no-c-format
msgid "Getting started"
msgstr "Eerste Schreed"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:569
#, no-c-format
msgid "Run &kchart; and select the <guilabel>Blank Worksheet</guilabel>."
msgstr "Maak &kchart; op, un söök <guilabel>Leddig Arbeitblatt</guilabel> ut."

#. Tag: screeninfo
#: index.docbook:573
#, no-c-format
msgid "Starting with a blank chart"
msgstr "Mit en leddig Diagramm anfangen"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:580
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Hit the button <guibutton>Use This Template</guibutton> to get started. "
"&kchart; will present to you a completely empty document. That's good, we "
"just need to enter some data and do some basic configuration to get a nice "
"chart."
msgstr ""
"Klick op den Knoop <guibutton>Disse Vörlaag bruken</guibutton>. &kchart; "
"wiest en leddig Dokment. Nu mööt wi en poor Daten ingeven un ok noch en poor "
"Grundinstellen fastleggen, dormit wi en smuck Diagramm kriggt."

#. Tag: screeninfo
#: index.docbook:586
#, no-c-format
msgid "A blank chart"
msgstr "En leddig Diagramm"

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:595
#, no-c-format
msgid "Getting the numbers in"
msgstr "Tallen ingeven"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:596
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The first step, and probably the most important, is to get the actual data "
"into the chart. This can easily be done with the &dataeditor;. As usual you "
"can get to the data editor by clicking on the "
"<inlinemediaobject><imageobject> <imagedata fileref=\"cr22-action-data.png\" "
"format=\"PNG\"/> </imageobject></inlinemediaobject> icon in the toolbar."
msgstr ""
"Toeerst, un dat is wull wichtigst, mööt de aktuellen Daten na't Diagramm "
"kamen. Dit lett sik eenfach mit den &dataeditor; doon. Normalerwies lett sik "
"de Dateneditor mit en Klick op dat <inlinemediaobject><imageobject> "
"<imagedata fileref=\"cr22-action-data.png\" format=\"PNG\"/> </imageobject></"
"inlinemediaobject>-Lüttbild binnen den Warktüüchbalken opropen."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:604
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"You will notice that no data is present. Also note that the number of data "
"rows and columns is set to a minimum, which is 1."
msgstr ""
"Du sühst, dat noch keen Daten vörhannen sünd. Beacht ok, dat de Tall vun "
"Datenregen un -striepen op en Minimaalweert vun \"1\" instellt is."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:609
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Now, just enter the data you see in the next screenshot. Note that you can "
"increase the number of rows and columns with the spin boxes in the lower "
"left corner. The names of the rows and columns themselves can be changed by "
"clicking on them."
msgstr ""
"Giff nu eenfach de Daten ut dat nakamen Schirmbild in. Beacht, dat sik de "
"Tall vun Regen un Striepen mit de Dreihfeller nerrn links ropsetten lett. De "
"Regen- un Striepennaams laat sik ännern, wenn se anklickt warrt."

#. Tag: screeninfo
#: index.docbook:617
#, no-c-format
msgid "The Data"
msgstr "De Daten"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:624
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Simply click the <guibutton>OK</guibutton> button when you are done. This "
"will present to you a simple bar chart."
msgstr ""
"Wenn Du fardig büst, klick eenfach op den Knoop <guibutton>OK</guibutton>. "
"Du hest en eenfach Balkendiagramm opstellt."

#. Tag: screeninfo
#: index.docbook:629
#, no-c-format
msgid "Simple chart without fine tuning"
msgstr "Eenfach Diagramm ahn besünner Enkelheiten"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:636
#, no-c-format
msgid "Read on to do some fine tuning!"
msgstr ""
"Lees wieder, wenn Du wat över dat Instellen vun Enkelheiten weten wullt."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:641
#, no-c-format
msgid "Fine Tuning"
msgstr "Enkelheiten instellen"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:642
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"We will now do some fine tuning and put a title on the chart. And, we will "
"add a nice 3D effect to the bars as well."
msgstr ""
"Nu warrt en poor Enkelheiten instellt, en Diagrammtitel, un ok noch en 3D-"
"Effekt toföögt."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:646
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Start up the configuration dialog by clicking on the "
"<inlinemediaobject><imageobject> <imagedata fileref=\"cr22-action-options.png"
"\" format=\"PNG\"/> </imageobject></inlinemediaobject> icon in the toolbar."
msgstr ""
"Roop den Instellendialoog mit en Klick op dat "
"<inlinemediaobject><imageobject> <imagedata fileref=\"cr22-action-options.png"
"\" format=\"PNG\"/> </imageobject></inlinemediaobject>-Lüttbild in'n "
"Warktüüchbalken op."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:653
#, no-c-format
msgid "Title"
msgstr "Titel"

#. Tag: screeninfo
#: index.docbook:655
#, no-c-format
msgid "Options - Title"
msgstr "Optschonen: Titel"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:662
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Let's start with labeling. Go to the <guilabel>Header/Footer</guilabel> page "
"and enter the text like in the above screenshot."
msgstr ""
"Nu warrt de Beteken ingeven. Gah na de Siet <guilabel>Kopp-/Footregen</"
"guilabel>, un giff den Text in, as in't Schirmbild baven wiest."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:668
#, no-c-format
msgid "X-Axis Font Settings"
msgstr "Schriftoort för de X-Ass instellen"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:669
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The next step is to make the font of the x axis a bit bigger. You can do "
"this on the <guilabel>Font</guilabel> page."
msgstr ""
"Nu warrt de Schriftoort för de X-Ass en beten grötter instellt. Dat kannst "
"Du op de <guilabel>Schriftoort</guilabel>-Siet doon."

#. Tag: screeninfo
#: index.docbook:674
#, no-c-format
msgid "Options - Fonts"
msgstr "Optschonen: Schriftoorden"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:681
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Choose the <guilabel>X-Axis</guilabel> item and click on the "
"<guibutton>Font...</guibutton> button. Choose a somewhat larger font like in "
"the following screenshot."
msgstr ""
"Söök den Punkt <guilabel>X-Ass</guilabel> ut un klick op den "
"<guibutton>Schriftoort...</guibutton>-Knoop. Söök en grötter Schriftoort ut, "
"as in't nakamen Schirmbild wiest."

#. Tag: screeninfo
#: index.docbook:687
#, no-c-format
msgid "Options - X-Axis Font"
msgstr "Optschonen: Schriftoort för de X-Ass"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:694
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Note that the font size is set to <guilabel>Relative</guilabel>. This means "
"that the font is automatically scaled according to the overall chart size. "
"This is quite usefull and most of the time what the average user expects."
msgstr ""
"Beacht, dat <guilabel>Relativ</guilabel> för de Schriftgrött ankrüüzt is. "
"Dat bedüüdt, dat se de Diagrammgrött automaatsch topasst warrt. Dat is en "
"fien Saak, un ok tomehrst dat, wat de Normaalbruker verwacht."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:702
#, no-c-format
msgid "Giving it a 3D Look"
msgstr "En 3D-Utsehn instellen"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:703
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Some types of charts like <guilabel>Bar</guilabel> and <guilabel>Pie</"
"guilabel> have an additional configuration page."
msgstr ""
"För en Reeg Diagrammen as a.B. <guilabel>Balken</guilabel> un "
"<guilabel>Koken</guilabel> gifft dat noch en anner Instellensiet."

#. Tag: screeninfo
#: index.docbook:708
#, no-c-format
msgid "Options - 3D Parameters"
msgstr "Optschonen: 3D-Parameters"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:715
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"To get a 3D effect for this type of chart, go to the <guilabel>Bar</"
"guilabel> page and simply activate <guilabel>3D bar</guilabel>."
msgstr ""
"För dissen Diagrammtyp lett sik op de <guilabel>Balken</guilabel>-Siet en 3D-"
"Effekt eenfach dör Ankrüzen vun <guilabel>3D-Balken</guilabel> an- oder "
"utmaken."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:719
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"That's all what we need for a reasonable looking chart. Note that much of "
"this configuration could also have been achieved with the wizard. It's "
"basically a matter of taste what you use. Experienced users will likely use "
"the full option dialog we used in this example."
msgstr ""
"Mehr warrt för en normaal Diagramm nich bruukt. Beacht, dat sik ok vele vun "
"disse Instellen mit den Hölper fastleggen laat. Man dat is en smacklich "
"Saak. Brukers mit mehr Könen bruukt wohrschienlich den Dialoog mit all "
"Instellenoptschonen, so as in't Bispill wiest."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:726
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Simply accept the settings by clicking on the <guibutton>OK</guibutton> "
"button."
msgstr ""
"Mit en Klick op den <guibutton>OK</guibutton>-Knoop warrt de Instellen heel "
"eenfach övernahmen."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:733
#, no-c-format
msgid "Final output"
msgstr "Utgaav"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:734
#, no-c-format
msgid "The final chart will look like the next screenshot."
msgstr "Dat fardige Diagramm schull liek as dat nakamen Schirmbild utsehn."

#. Tag: screeninfo
#: index.docbook:738
#, no-c-format
msgid "Final Chart"
msgstr "Fardig Diagramm"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:745
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"You might want to enlarge the application window to see the chart in full "
"size. Note how the fonts get larger in relation to the chart size."
msgstr ""
"Villicht wullt Du dat Programmfinster wat grötter maken, dormit Du dat "
"Diagramm in Heelgrött ankieken kannst. Beacht, dat sik tosamen mit de "
"Diagrammgrött ok de Schriftgrött ännert."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:750
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"There are certainly aspects to improve further for your personal taste. For "
"example try to make the title font even bigger. Just experiment further, "
"this way you will get to know a lot of the &kchart; application."
msgstr ""
"Dat gifft seker noch anner Saken, de sik na Dien Möög topassen laat. So lett "
"sik a.B. de Schriftoort vun den Titel noch grötter maken. Probeer dat "
"Programm eenfach wieder ut. Op disse Oort lett sik op't best noch mehr över "
"&kchart; rutfinnen."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:756
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Finally you can save the chart from the <guimenu>File</guimenu> menu and "
"quit &kchart; with <menuchoice><guimenu>File</guimenu> <guimenuitem>Quit</"
"guimenuitem> </menuchoice>"
msgstr ""
"In't <guimenu>Datei</guimenu>-Menü kannst Du nu dat Diagramm noch sekern un "
"&kchart; mit <menuchoice><guimenu>Datei</guimenu> <guimenuitem>Verlaten</"
"guimenuitem> </menuchoice> utmaken."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:765
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Exporting to Graphic Formats: SVG, PNG, JPG, &krita;, &karbon14;, Gimp and "
"more"
msgstr ""
"Na SVG, PNG, JPG, &krita;, &karbon14;, Gimp un anner Formaten exporteren"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:767
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"For further processing, the chart can also be exported as a graphics file. "
"Many formats are available. Using either PNG, SVG, JPG or &krita; will "
"likely produce the best result."
msgstr ""
"För't Wiederverarbeiden lett sik dat Diagramm ok na en Bilddatei exporteren. "
"Dor steiht en helen Barg Formaten för praat. De besten Resultaten gifft dat "
"wull mit PNG, SVG, JPG oder &krita;."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:772
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"To export your current chart simply choose <menuchoice><guimenu>File</"
"guimenu> <guimenuitem>Export...</guimenuitem></menuchoice> from the menu and "
"select the desired file format from the filter box."
msgstr ""
"Wenn Du Dien Diagramm exporteren wullt, klick eenfach in't Menü op "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>Datei</guimenu> <guimenuitem>Exporteren...</"
"guimenuitem></menuchoice> un söök ut dat Filterfinster dat Dateiformaat ut."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:791
#, no-c-format
msgid "Using &kchart; in &kspread;"
msgstr "&kchart; binnen &kspread; bruken"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:793
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"In addition to standalone operation, &kchart; is designed to be used with "
"&kspread;. This chapter describes how to create and manipulate charts from "
"within &kspread;."
msgstr ""
"&kchart; lett sik nich bloots as Enkelprogramm, sünnern ok tosamen mit "
"&kspread; bruken. Disse Afsnitt verklort, wodennig sik Diagrammen binnen "
"&kspread; opstellen un ännern laat."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:798
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Remember that &kchart; embedding into &kspread; is a very commonly used and "
"well implemented feature, the examples in this chapter should just get you "
"started."
msgstr ""
"Beacht, dat &kchart;, na &kspread; inbett, en faken bruukt un goot inbuut "
"Funkschoon is. De nakamen Bispillen schöölt Di den Start lichter maken."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:803
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"As soon as you have created a chart in &kspread; you can take full advantage "
"of all the &kchart; features by double clicking on the chart area. This is "
"necessary to get to all advanced configuration options. Keep in mind that "
"the data editor is not available when &kchart; is embedded into &kspread;. "
"This is obvious since &kspread; serves, from &kchart;'s point of view, as a "
"powerful data provider."
msgstr ""
"Wenn Du en Diagramm mit &kspread; opstellt hest, kannst Du mit en "
"Dubbelklick op dat Diagramm all Funkschonen vun &kchart; bruken. So laat sik "
"ok all verwiedert Instellenfunkschonen opropen. Beacht,  dat de Dateneditor "
"nich verföögbor is, wenn &kchart; na &kspread; inbett is. Dit is ok kloor, "
"wiel &kspread;, tominnst ut de Sicht vun &kchart;, deDaten praatstellt."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:812
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Swapping x and y is of particular interest when working with &kspread;. You "
"can swap interpretation of x and y axis in &kchart; in the Data Format "
"settings which can be accessed through the Edit menu or the context menu "
"when right clicking on the chart itself. As noted above you need to be "
"inside the &kchart; component in order to access these settings, which can "
"be done by double clicking the embedded chart in your spreadsheet."
msgstr ""
"Bi't Arbeiden mit &kspread; is mennigmaal de Tuusch vun X un Y intressant. "
"Du kannst de Dorstellen vun de X- un Y-Assen in &kchart; in de Instellen för "
"dat Datenformaat tuschen. Se laat sik in't Menü \"Bewerken\" oder mit en "
"Rechtsklick op dat Diagramm opropen. As al baven seggt, muttst Du binnen de "
"&kchart;-Komponent wesen, wenn Du op disse Instellen togriepen wullt. Dor "
"kummst Du mit en Dubbelklick op dat inbett Diagram binnen dat Datenblatt hen."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:823
#, no-c-format
msgid "Plotting with &kchart;"
msgstr "Teken mit &kchart;"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:824
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"To plot with &kchart;, when it is embedded in &kspread;, do the following:"
msgstr "So lett sik mit &kchart; plotten, wenn dat binnen &kspread; inbett is:"

#. Tag: screeninfo
#: index.docbook:827 index.docbook:861 index.docbook:1262 index.docbook:1277
#, no-c-format
msgid "Picture of toolbars dialog"
msgstr "Bild vun den Warktüüchbalken-Dialoog"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:836
#, no-c-format
msgid "Highlight the second row of numbers."
msgstr "Markeer de twete Reeg vun Tallen."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:840
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Next click on the <guilabel>Chart</guilabel> button "
"<inlinemediaobject><imageobject><imagedata fileref=\"frame_chart.png\" "
"format=\"PNG\"/></imageobject></inlinemediaobject> to create the chart."
msgstr ""
"Nu op den <guilabel>Diagramm</guilabel>-Knoop "
"<inlinemediaobject><imageobject><imagedata fileref=\"frame_chart.png\" "
"format=\"PNG\"/></imageobject></inlinemediaobject>, dormit dat Diagramm "
"opstellt warrt.."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:846
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Select the options you want from the chart wizard. The chart Wizard will pop "
"up after you insert the chart."
msgstr ""
"Söök ut den Diagrammhölper de nödigen Optschonen ut. De Hölper dukt op, "
"nadeem Du dat Diagramm infögt hest."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:851
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The whole data could also be created using two columns instead of two rows. "
"If using columns you might want to switch x and y axis in the &kchart; "
"configuration as described above."
msgstr ""
"All Daten laat sik ok mit twee Striepen ansteed vun twee Regen opstellen. "
"Wenn Du Striepen bruukst, wullt Du villicht de X- un Y-Assen in de &kchart;-"
"Instellen tuschen, as dat al baven beschreven wöör."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:857
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"To make a bar chart for individual items, put the numbers in a column, as "
"shown below."
msgstr ""
"Wenn Du en Balkendiagramm för egen Indrääg opstellen wullt, giff de Tallen "
"binnen en Striep in, as nerrn to sehn."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:869
#, no-c-format
msgid "The orientation of the numbers determines how the plot will be made."
msgstr ""
"De Utrichten vun de Tallen leggt fast, wodennig dat Plottbild opstellt warrt."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:873
#, no-c-format
msgid "A row of numbers defines the ordinates for a single plot."
msgstr "En Tall vun Regen leggt de Y-Koordinaten för en Plottbild fast."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:877
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"A column of numbers defines the heights for each bar, in a bar graph. It "
"also determines the size of the slices in a pie chart."
msgstr ""
"En Striep vun Tallen leggt de Hööchden för elk Balken in en Balkendiagramm "
"fast. He gifft ok de Grött vun de Delen binnen en Kokendiagramm an."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:887
#, no-c-format
msgid "Command Reference"
msgstr "Befehlen"

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:890
#, no-c-format
msgid "The Main &kchart; Window"
msgstr "Dat Hööftfinster vun &kchart;"

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:893
#, no-c-format
msgid "The <guimenu>File</guimenu> Menu"
msgstr "Dat Menü <guimenu>Datei</guimenu>"

