msgstr ""
"<shortcut> <keycombo action=\"simul\">&Ctrl;<keycap>N</keycap></keycombo> </"
"shortcut> <guimenu>Datei</guimenu> <guimenuitem>Nieg</guimenuitem>"

#. Tag: action
#: index.docbook:904
#, no-c-format
msgid "Creates a new document"
msgstr "Stellt en nieg Dokment op"

#. Tag: menuchoice
#: index.docbook:908
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<shortcut> <keycombo action=\"simul\">&Ctrl;<keycap>O</keycap></keycombo> </"
"shortcut> <guimenu>File</guimenu> <guimenuitem>Open...</guimenuitem>"
msgstr ""
"<shortcut> <keycombo action=\"simul\">&Ctrl;<keycap>O</keycap></keycombo> </"
"shortcut> <guimenu>Datei</guimenu> <guimenuitem>Opmaken...</guimenuitem>"

#. Tag: action
#: index.docbook:915
#, no-c-format
msgid "Opens a document"
msgstr "Maakt en Dokment op"

#. Tag: menuchoice
#: index.docbook:919
#, no-c-format
msgid "<guimenu>File</guimenu> <guisubmenu>Open Recent</guisubmenu>"
msgstr "<guimenu>Datei</guimenu> <guisubmenu>Verleden opmaken</guisubmenu>"

#. Tag: action
#: index.docbook:923
#, no-c-format
msgid "Shows a list of recently opened documents"
msgstr "Wiest en List vun tolest opmaakt Dokmenten"

#. Tag: menuchoice
#: index.docbook:927
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<shortcut> <keycombo action=\"simul\">&Ctrl;<keycap>S</keycap></keycombo> </"
"shortcut> <guimenu>File</guimenu> <guimenuitem>Save</guimenuitem>"
msgstr ""
"<shortcut> <keycombo action=\"simul\">&Ctrl;<keycap>S</keycap></keycombo> </"
"shortcut> <guimenu>Datei</guimenu> <guimenuitem>Sekern</guimenuitem>"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:934
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<action>Saves the chart to the current file.</action> If the chart has not "
"yet been saved the file dialog is shown."
msgstr ""
"<action>Sekert dat Diagramm na de aktuelle Datei.</action> Wenn dat Diagramm "
"noch nich sekert wöör, warrt en Dialoog wiest."

#. Tag: menuchoice
#: index.docbook:939
#, no-c-format
msgid "<guimenu>File</guimenu> <guimenuitem>Save As...</guimenuitem>"
msgstr "<guimenu>Datei</guimenu> <guimenuitem>Sekern as...</guimenuitem>"

#. Tag: action
#: index.docbook:943
#, no-c-format
msgid "Saves the document, the file dialog is used."
msgstr "Sekert dat Dokment. De Dateidialoog warrt bruukt."

#. Tag: menuchoice
#: index.docbook:947
#, no-c-format
msgid "<guimenu>File</guimenu> <guimenuitem>Reload</guimenuitem>"
msgstr "<guimenu>Datei</guimenu> <guimenuitem>Nieg laden...</guimenuitem>"

#. Tag: action
#: index.docbook:951
#, no-c-format
msgid "Reloads the document."
msgstr "Laadt dat Dokment nieg"

#. Tag: menuchoice
#: index.docbook:956
#, no-c-format
msgid "<guimenu>File</guimenu> <guimenuitem>Import...</guimenuitem>"
msgstr "<guimenu>Datei</guimenu> <guimenuitem>Importeren...</guimenuitem>"

#. Tag: action
#: index.docbook:960
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Opens a document with any supported format. The original document will not "
"be modified."
msgstr "Maakt en ünnerstütt Dokment op. Dat Orginaaldokment warrt nich ännert."

#. Tag: menuchoice
#: index.docbook:966
#, no-c-format
msgid "<guimenu>File</guimenu> <guimenuitem>Export...</guimenuitem>"
msgstr "<guimenu>Datei</guimenu> <guimenuitem>Exporteren...</guimenuitem>"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:970
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<action>Saves a document to any supported format.</action> The original "
"document will not be modified. You can also choose among many image formats "
"like PNG, SVG, &krita;, Gimp or JPG."
msgstr ""
"<action>Sekert en Dokment na jichtenseen ünnerstütt Formaat.</action> Dat "
"Orginaaldokment warrt nich ännert. Du kannst ok Bildformaten utsöken, a.B. "
"PNG, SVG, &krita;, Gimp oder JPG."

#. Tag: menuchoice
#: index.docbook:977
#, no-c-format
msgid "<guimenu>File</guimenu> <guimenuitem>Mail...</guimenuitem>"
msgstr "<guimenu>Datei</guimenu> <guimenuitem>Nettpost...</guimenuitem>"

#. Tag: action
#: index.docbook:981
#, no-c-format
msgid "Sends the chart as an email attachment."
msgstr "Stüert dat Diagramm as Nettbreefbilaag loos."

#. Tag: menuchoice
#: index.docbook:985
#, no-c-format
msgid "<guimenu>File</guimenu> <guimenuitem>Import Data...</guimenuitem>"
msgstr ""
"<guimenu>Datei</guimenu> <guimenuitem>Daten importeren...</guimenuitem>"

#. Tag: action
#: index.docbook:989
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Imports values from a CSV (Comma Separated Values) file, much like the CSV "
"import in &kspread;. Note that you can specify various options and different "
"separators (not just commas)."
msgstr ""
"Importeert Weerten ut en CSV-Datei (mit Kommas trennte Weerten), liek as de "
"CSV-Import in &kspread;. Beacht, dat sik ok anner Optschonen un verscheden "
"Trenners fastleggen laat, un nich bloots Kommas."

#. Tag: menuchoice
#: index.docbook:996
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<guimenu>File</guimenu> <guimenuitem>Create Template From Document...</"
"guimenuitem>"
msgstr ""
"<guimenu>Datei</guimenu> <guimenuitem>Vörlaag ut Dokment opstellen...</"
"guimenuitem>"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1000
#, no-c-format
msgid "Create a &kchart; template based on this document."
msgstr "Stellt ut dissen Dokment en &kchart;-Vörlaag op."

#. Tag: menuchoice
#: index.docbook:1006
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<shortcut> <keycombo action=\"simul\">&Ctrl;<keycap>P</keycap></keycombo> </"
"shortcut> <guimenu>File</guimenu> <guimenuitem>Print...</guimenuitem>"
msgstr ""
"<shortcut> <keycombo action=\"simul\">&Ctrl;<keycap>P</keycap></keycombo> </"
"shortcut> <guimenu>Datei</guimenu> <guimenuitem>Drucken...</guimenuitem>"

#. Tag: action
#: index.docbook:1013
#, no-c-format
msgid "Prints the document"
msgstr "Druckt dat Dokment"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1014
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Make sure the proper print system is selected in the <guilabel>Print system "
"currently used:</guilabel> section. This option can be seen after clicking "
"on the <guibutton>Options &gt;&gt;</guibutton> button."
msgstr ""
"Stell seker, dat in <guilabel>Aktuell bruukt Drucksysteem:</guilabel> dat "
"richtige Drucksysteem utsöcht is. Disse Optschoon warrt na en Klick op den "
"<guibutton>Optschonen &gt;&gt;</guibutton>-Knoop wiest."

#. Tag: menuchoice
#: index.docbook:1020
#, no-c-format
msgid "<guimenu>File</guimenu> <guimenuitem>Print Preview...</guimenuitem>"
msgstr "<guimenu>Datei</guimenu> <guimenuitem>Druckvöransicht...</guimenuitem>"

#. Tag: action
#: index.docbook:1024
#, no-c-format
msgid "Displays a preview of what the printed document will look like."
msgstr "Wiest en Druckvöransicht vun dat Dokment."

#. Tag: menuchoice
#: index.docbook:1029
#, no-c-format
msgid "<guimenu>File</guimenu> <guimenuitem>Document Information</guimenuitem>"
msgstr ""
"<guimenu>Datei</guimenu> <guimenuitem>Dokment-Informatschonen</guimenuitem>"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1033
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<action>Opens a dialog box</action> where you can enter information about "
"your chart."
msgstr ""
"<action>Maakt en Dialoogfinster op</action>, binnen dat sik Informatschonen "
"över dat Diagramm ingeven laat."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1035
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"This document information will be displayed in the &konqueror; file browser "
"as a tooltip. The tooltips are pop-ups that show the contents of a file when "
"you move your mouse over the file icon."
msgstr ""
"De Dateikieker &konqueror; wiest disse Dokmentinfomatschoon as "
"Kortinformatschoon. De Kortinformatschonen sünd Opdukers, de Dateiinholden "
"wiest, wenn Du mit de Muus dat Dateilüttbild anröögst."

#. Tag: menuchoice
#: index.docbook:1042
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<shortcut> <keycombo action=\"simul\">&Ctrl;<keycap>W</keycap></keycombo> </"
"shortcut> <guimenu>File</guimenu> <guimenuitem>Close</guimenuitem>"
msgstr ""
"<shortcut> <keycombo action=\"simul\">&Ctrl;<keycap>W</keycap></keycombo> </"
"shortcut> <guimenu>Datei</guimenu> <guimenuitem>Tomaken</guimenuitem>"

#. Tag: action
#: index.docbook:1049
#, no-c-format
msgid "Closes the current chart."
msgstr "Maakt dat aktuelle Diagramm to."

#. Tag: menuchoice
#: index.docbook:1053
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<shortcut> <keycombo action=\"simul\">&Ctrl;<keycap>Q</keycap></keycombo> </"
"shortcut> <guimenu>File</guimenu> <guimenuitem>Quit</guimenuitem>"
msgstr ""
"<shortcut> <keycombo action=\"simul\">&Ctrl;<keycap>Q</keycap></keycombo> </"
"shortcut> <guimenu>Datei</guimenu> <guimenuitem>Quit</guimenuitem>"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1060
#, no-c-format
msgid "<action>Quits</action> &kchart;"
msgstr "<action>Beendt</action> &kchart;"

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:1067
#, no-c-format
msgid "The <guimenu>Edit</guimenu> Menu"
msgstr "Dat Menü <guimenu>Bewerken</guimenu>"

#. Tag: menuchoice
#: index.docbook:1071
#, no-c-format
msgid "<guimenu>Edit</guimenu> <guimenuitem>Edit Data...</guimenuitem>"
msgstr ""
"<guimenu>Bewerken</guimenu> <guimenuitem>Daten bewerken...</guimenuitem>"

#. Tag: action
#: index.docbook:1075
#, no-c-format
msgid "Opens the &dataeditor;."
msgstr "Maakt den &dataeditor; op"

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:1081
#, no-c-format
msgid "The <guimenu>Format</guimenu> Menu"
msgstr "Dat Menü <guimenu>Formaat</guimenu>"

#. Tag: menuchoice
#: index.docbook:1085
#, no-c-format
msgid "<guimenu>Format</guimenu> <guimenuitem>Chart...</guimenuitem>"
msgstr "<guimenu>Formaat</guimenu> <guimenuitem>Diagramm...</guimenuitem>"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1089
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<action>Opens</action> the <link linkend=\"configurationinterface\">&kchart; "
"Configuration</link> dialog."
msgstr ""
"<action>Maakt</action> den <link linkend=\"configurationinterface\">&kchart;-"
"Instellendialoog</link> op."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:1096
#, no-c-format
msgid "The Configure Tabs"
msgstr "De Instellen-Paneels"

#. Tag: guimenu
#: index.docbook:1100
#, no-c-format
msgid "Data Format..."
msgstr "Datenformaat..."

#. Tag: action
#: index.docbook:1102
#, no-c-format
msgid "Swap row and colums (x/y flipping)."
msgstr "Regen un Striepen tuschen (X un Y tuschen)"

#. Tag: guimenu
#: index.docbook:1108
#, no-c-format
msgid "Chart Sub-type..."
msgstr "Diagramm-Ünnertyp..."

#. Tag: action
#: index.docbook:1110
#, no-c-format
msgid "Changes the arrangement of bar graphs."
msgstr "Ännert de Anornen vun Balkendiagrammen."

#. Tag: guimenu
#: index.docbook:1116
#, no-c-format
msgid "Header &amp; Footer..."
msgstr "Kopp- &amp; Footreeg..."

#. Tag: action
#: index.docbook:1118
#, no-c-format
msgid "Enter the titles you want for your graph here."
msgstr "Giff hier de Titels för Dien Diagramm in."

#. Tag: guimenu
#: index.docbook:1124
#, no-c-format
msgid "Colors..."
msgstr "Klören..."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1126
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<action>Select graph colors</action>, line colors, grid colors and axis "
"title and axis label colors here."
msgstr ""
"Hier kannst Du <action>Diagrammklören utsöken</action>, Lienen- un "
"Gadderklören, un de Klören för Assentitel un Assenbeteken."

#. Tag: guimenu
#: index.docbook:1133
#, no-c-format
msgid "Font..."
msgstr "Schriftoort..."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1135
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<action>Select font style and size</action> here. The series colors can be "
"selected here also. The series refer to the individual graphs. Each graphed "
"set of data is a series."
msgstr ""
"Hier kannst Du de <action>Schriftoort un -grött utsöken</action>. Hier laat "
"sik ok de Regenklören fastleggen. De Regen höört de Enkeltekens to. Elk "
"dorstellt Datensett is en Reeg."

#. Tag: guimenu
#: index.docbook:1143
#, no-c-format
msgid "Background..."
msgstr "Achtergrund..."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1145
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<action>Select a color or a wallpaper</action> as background for your graph."
msgstr ""
"<action>Söök en Klöör oder en Achtergrundbild</action> as Achtergrund för "
"Dien Diagramm ut."

#. Tag: guimenu
#: index.docbook:1152
#, no-c-format
msgid "Legend..."
msgstr "Verkloren..."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1154
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<action>Change title, font and location of the legend</action> box. The "
"color of the legend box can be changed also."
msgstr ""
"Finster för't <action>Ännern vun Titel, Schrift un de Utrichten vun de "
"Verkloren</action>. De Klöör vun dat Verklorenfinster lett sik ok ännern."

#. Tag: guimenu
#: index.docbook:1161
#, no-c-format
msgid "Page Layout..."
msgstr "Sietutsehn..."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1163
#, no-c-format
msgid "<action>Set the <guilabel>Margins</guilabel> of the page</action> here."
msgstr "<action>Legg hier de <guilabel>Siedenränners</guilabel></action> fast."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:1172
#, no-c-format
msgid "The <guimenu>Settings</guimenu> Menu"
msgstr "Dat Menü <guimenu>Instellen</guimenu>"

#. Tag: menuchoice
#: index.docbook:1177
