#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:1214
#, no-c-format
msgid "Configuring Shortcuts"
msgstr "Tastkombinatschonen instellen"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1216
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The <menuchoice> <guimenu>Settings</guimenu><guimenuitem>Configure "
"Shortcuts...</guimenuitem></menuchoice> allows you to specify shortcuts."
msgstr ""
"Mit <menuchoice> <guimenu>Instellen</"
"guimenu><guimenuitem>Tastkombinatschonen instellen...</guimenuitem></"
"menuchoice> laat sik Tastkombinatschonen fastleggen."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1221
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Below is an example of how to configure a shortcut for opening the chart "
"wizard."
msgstr ""
"Nerrn en Bispill, wodennig sik en Tastkombinatschoon för't Opmaken vun dat "
"Diagramm fastleggen lett."

#. Tag: screeninfo
#: index.docbook:1225
#, no-c-format
msgid "Picture of shortcut dialog"
msgstr "Bild vun den Tastkombinatschonen-Dialoog"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1234
#, no-c-format
msgid "Click on <guibutton>Custom</guibutton>."
msgstr "Klick op <guibutton>Egen</guibutton>."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1238
#, no-c-format
msgid "Next click on <guibutton>Primary shortcut:</guibutton>."
msgstr "Nu klick <guibutton>Eerst Kombinatschoon:</guibutton> an."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1242
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Do <userinput><keycombo action=\"seq\">&Alt;&Ctrl;<keycap>W</keycap></"
"keycombo></userinput> and the dialog should disappear. The shortcut is now "
"entered."
msgstr ""
"Nu drück de Tasten <userinput><keycombo action=\"seq\">&Alt;&Ctrl;<keycap>W</"
"keycap></keycombo></userinput>, un de Dialoog schull weggahn. De "
"Tastkombinatschoon is nu ingeven."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1249
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Pressing the keys <userinput><keycombo action=\"seq\">&Alt;&Ctrl;<keycap>W</"
"keycap></keycombo></userinput> now opens the wizard."
msgstr ""
"De Tastkombinatschoon <userinput><keycombo action=\"seq\">&Alt;&Ctrl;"
"<keycap>W</keycap></keycombo></userinput> röppt nu den Hölper op."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:1256
#, no-c-format
msgid "Configuring Toolbars"
msgstr "Warktüüchbalkens instellen"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1257
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The <menuchoice> <guimenu>Settings</guimenu><guimenuitem>Configure "
"Toolbars...</guimenuitem></menuchoice> is used to add additional buttons to "
"the toolbars."
msgstr ""
"Mit de <menuchoice> <guimenu>Instellen</guimenu> "
"<guimenuitem>Warktüüchbalkens instellen...</guimenuitem></menuchoice> laat "
"sik de Warktüüchbalkens noch mehr Knööp tofögen."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1273
#, no-c-format
msgid "To add a button to the <guilabel>File</guilabel> toolbar,"
msgstr ""
"Wenn Du en Knoop na den <guilabel>Datei</guilabel>-Warktüüchbalken tofögen "
"wullt,"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1285
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"make sure <guilabel>File &lt;&koffice;&gt;</guilabel> is displayed in the "
"top combo box."
msgstr ""
"stell seker, dat baven in't Utsöökfeld <guilabel>Datei &lt;&koffice;&gt;</"
"guilabel> wiest warrt."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1289
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Click on one of the items in the left hand pane. This item will now be "
"highlighted showing that it has been selected."
msgstr ""
"Klick op een vun de Indrääg in't Paneel linkerhand. Disse Indrag warrt nu "
"rutheevt, wat bedüüdt, dat de utsöcht wöör."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1294
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Next click on the <guiicon>Right arrow</guiicon> button to place it in the "
"right pane."
msgstr ""
"En Klick op den <guiicon>Piel rechts</guiicon>-Knoop föögt em na't Paneel "
"rechterhand to."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1299
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Click on <userinput><guilabel>Apply</guilabel></userinput> and then click on "
"<userinput><guilabel>OK</guilabel></userinput>"
msgstr ""
"Klick op <userinput><guilabel>Anwennen</guilabel></userinput> un denn op "
"<userinput><guilabel>OK</guilabel></userinput>"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1306
#, no-c-format
msgid "The new Item should be in the toolbar."
msgstr "De Warktüüchbalken schull nu den niegen Indrag bargen."

